---
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Gosub! Break the Web</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@1,900&family=Work+Sans:wght@500;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style lang="scss">
      :root {
        --yellow: #FAFF00;
        --red: #FF003C;
        --blue: #0029FF;
        --black: #050505;
        --white: #F4F4F4;
        --font-headline: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
        --font-serif: 'Playfair Display', serif;
        --font-sans: 'Work Sans', sans-serif;
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      
      body {
        background-color: var(--yellow);
        color: var(--black);
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
        overflow-x: hidden;
      }

      .noise-bg {
        position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
        background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"%3E%3Cfilter id="noiseFilter"%3E%3CfeTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="1.5" numOctaves="3" stitchTiles="stitch"/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width="100%25" height="100%25" filter="url(%23noiseFilter)"/%3E%3C/svg%3E');
        opacity: 0.15; z-index: 100; pointer-events: none; mix-blend-mode: overlay;
      }

      .sticker {
        position: absolute;
        background: var(--red);
        color: var(--white);
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        font-family: var(--font-headline);
        font-size: 2rem;
        border-radius: 50%;
        width: 150px; height: 150px;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;
        transform: rotate(-15deg);
        box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--black);
        z-index: 50;
        animation: spin-pulse 4s infinite linear alternate;
        
        &.blue { background: var(--blue); transform: rotate(10deg); right: 10%; top: 20%; width: 200px; height: 200px; font-size: 3rem; animation-delay: 1s; }
        &.black { background: var(--black); color: var(--yellow); bottom: 10%; left: 5%; border-radius: 0; transform: rotate(-5deg); width: auto; height: auto; padding: 1rem 2rem; }
      }

      @keyframes spin-pulse {
        0% { transform: scale(1) rotate(-15deg); }
        100% { transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-5deg); }
      }

      header {
        padding: 2rem;
        display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;

        .logo {
          font-family: var(--font-headline);
          font-size: 5rem;
          color: var(--blue);
          text-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--black);
          transform: rotate(-2deg);
        }

        nav a {
          font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.5rem;
          color: var(--black); text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase;
          margin-left: 2rem; border-bottom: 4px solid var(--black);
          &:hover { background: var(--black); color: var(--yellow); }
        }
      }

      main { padding: 5rem; position: relative; }

      .hero {
        text-align: left;
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 10;

        h1 {
          font-family: var(--font-headline);
          font-size: clamp(6rem, 15vw, 15rem);
          line-height: 0.8;
          text-transform: uppercase;
          color: var(--black);
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
          
          span {
            font-family: var(--font-serif);
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--white);
            background: var(--blue);
            padding: 0 2rem;
            display: inline-block;
            transform: rotate(-3deg);
            box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 var(--red);
          }
        }

        .subtitle {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
          font-weight: 800;
          color: var(--white);
          background: var(--black);
          padding: 1rem 2rem;
          display: inline-block;
          margin-top: 2rem;
          max-width: 800px;
          line-height: 1.2;
          box-shadow: 15px 15px 0 var(--blue);
          transform: rotate(1deg);
        }
      }

      .chaos-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
        gap: 2rem;
        margin-top: 10rem;
        padding: 5rem 0;

        .card {
          background: var(--white);
          border: 8px solid var(--black);
          padding: 3rem;
          box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 var(--red);
          transition: 0.2s;
          position: relative;

          &:nth-child(even) { transform: translateY(50px) rotate(2deg); box-shadow: -12px 12px 0 var(--blue); }
          &:nth-child(odd) { transform: rotate(-2deg); }

          &:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05) rotate(0); z-index: 20;
            box-shadow: 20px 20px 0 var(--black);
            background: var(--yellow);
          }

          h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-headline);
            font-size: 4rem;
            line-height: 0.9;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
          }

          p { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 500; }
        }
      }

      .marquee-huge {
        white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden;
        background: var(--red); color: var(--yellow);
        font-family: var(--font-serif); font-style: italic; font-size: 8rem;
        padding: 1rem 0; border-top: 10px solid var(--black); border-bottom: 10px solid var(--black);
        margin-top: 5rem; transform: rotate(-3deg) scale(1.1);
        
        div {
          display: inline-block;
          animation: marquee 10s linear infinite;
        }
      }

      @keyframes marquee { 0% { transform: translateX(0); } 100% { transform: translateX(-50%); } }

    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="noise-bg"></div>
    <div class="sticker">MODULAR!</div>
    <div class="sticker blue">NO FORKS.</div>
    
    <header>
      <div class="logo">GOSUB.</div>
      <nav>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#github">Code</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <h1>THE WEB IS <span>BROKEN.</span></h1>
        <div class="subtitle">WE'RE BUILDING A MODULAR ENGINE TO FIX IT. NO CORPORATE AGENDA. JUST PURE RUST.</div>
      </section>

      <div class="marquee-huge">
        <div>BUILT BY VOLUNTEERS • WRITTEN IN RUST • SWAP THE RENDERER • NO CORPORATE AGENDA • BUILT BY VOLUNTEERS • WRITTEN IN RUST • SWAP THE RENDERER • NO CORPORATE AGENDA •</div>
      </div>

      <section class="chaos-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>RADICAL MODULARITY</h3>
          <p>Every module works standalone. Want a headless document processor? A custom rendering pipeline? Pick your components.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>RUST BUILT</h3>
          <p>Memory safe. Blazing fast. Built from the ground up to challenge the trinary browser monoculture.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>VELLO GPU</h3>
          <p>GPU-accelerated rendering via wgpu. The modern web needs modern compute. Pure visual violence.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      
      <div class="sticker black">MIT LICENSED</div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
